{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S05等短停留段中，小感受词有时成串同时出现，容易让观众来不及消化；X的双栏分区在这种情况下反而更容易区分故事和感受。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"平\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】把每段真正推动故事的关键意思凸显出来，话与感受交替出现，部分感受又跟随音乐在对应位置出现，观众更容易边听边抓住人物的行动、动机和情绪转折。尤其在细腻度上，Y不只告诉观众他高兴、害怕或舍不得，还呈现了身体反应、空间感、情绪中的矛盾以及音乐起落带来的细微变化。两版的故事主线基本一致，X的完整叙述有时反而更连贯，所以整体连贯性判平。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "22374b34-338b-4ffc-932c-196af775e087", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T231851871374Z", "elapsed_seconds": 60.172, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:19:52.038902+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e2c7933d7996a8e881a7a7b124147dbbb7cc91cbf83d4cec3c66135ad867ab83", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\g